---
layout: minimal.njk
title: Mah Jongg Reference
description: Personal American Mah Jongg reference card
pageCss: /assets/css/mahjong.css
---

<div class="min-h-screen bg-base-200">
  <div id="app">
    <!-- Sticky header -->
    <div class="navbar bg-base-100 shadow-md sticky top-0 z-30 min-h-0 py-2">
      <div class="flex-1">
        <span class="text-lg font-bold px-2">🀄 Mah Jongg</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex-none gap-1">
        <select id="year-select" class="select select-bordered select-sm w-24"></select>
        <button id="session-btn" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">Log in</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-3 py-4 pb-24">
      <div id="alert-container" class="mb-3"></div>

      <!-- Search -->
      <input
        id="search"
        type="search"
        inputmode="search"
        placeholder="Search hands — e.g. 2468, FF, dragons"
        class="input input-bordered w-full mb-3"
      />

      <!-- Hands -->
      <div id="loading" class="flex justify-center py-10">
        <span class="loading loading-spinner loading-lg"></span>
      </div>

      <div id="empty-state" class="hidden text-center py-10">
        <div class="text-5xl mb-3">🀄</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-1">No hands yet</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70 mb-4">
          Add hands from your card to build the reference.
        </p>
        <button id="empty-add-btn" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm hidden">Add first hand</button>
      </div>

      <div id="no-results" class="hidden text-center py-8 text-sm text-base-content/60">
        No hands match that search.
      </div>

      <div id="hands-container" class="hidden space-y-3"></div>

      <!-- ── Rules reference (general rules, not card content) ──────────── -->
      <h2 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-base-content/50 mt-8 mb-2 px-1">
        Rules Reference
      </h2>

      <div class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-100 shadow-sm mb-2">
        <input type="checkbox" />
        <div class="collapse-title font-semibold">📖 Tiles & Notation</div>
        <div class="collapse-content text-sm space-y-2">
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold mb-1">The 152 tiles</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-0.5">
              <li>108 suit tiles — four of each 1-9 in three suits: Bams, Craks, Dots.</li>
              <li>16 winds — N, E, W, S, four of each</li>
              <li>12 dragons — Red, Green, White (Soap), four of each</li>
              <li>8 flowers</li>
              <li>8 jokers</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold mb-1">Dragon ↔ suit pairing</p>
            <p>Red goes with Craks · Green with Bams · Soap with Dots.</p>
          </div>
          <hr>
          <p class="font-semibold mb-1">Hands are written the way they are printed on the card:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
            <li><strong>1–9</strong> — a numbered tile in a suit</li>
            <li><strong>D</strong> —  Dragon</li>
            <li><strong>F</strong> — Flower</li>
            <li><strong>N E W S</strong> — North, East, West, South</li>
            <li><strong>0</strong> — White/Soap dragon</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="pt-1">
            A color indicates tiles in ONE suit.<br />
            Different colors are different suits.<br />
            Dragons in color match their suit pairing (Red ↔ Craks, Green ↔ Bams, Soap ↔ Dots).<br />
            Flowers and winds are always neutral.<br />
            Dragons in gray are neutral and may be any dragon.
          </p>
          <p class="pt-1">
            <strong>Pung</strong> - Three identical tiles<br />
            <strong>Kong</strong> - Four identical tiles<br />
            <strong>Quint</strong> - Five identical tiles (must include a Joker)<br />

          </p>

          <p>
            <span class="badge badge-sm badge-neutral">C</span> = concealed hand ·
            <span class="badge badge-sm badge-outline">X</span> = may be exposed
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-100 shadow-sm mb-2">
        <input type="checkbox" />
        <div class="collapse-title font-semibold">🔄 Charleston</div>
        <div class="collapse-content text-sm space-y-3">
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold mb-1">First Charleston (required)</p>
            <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-0.5">
              <li>Pass 3 right</li>
              <li>Pass 3 across</li>
              <li>Pass 3 left — may be a blind pass</li>
            </ol>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold mb-1">Second Charleston (optional)</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-base-content/70 mb-1">
              Any single player may stop it.
            </p>
            <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-0.5" start="4">
              <li>Pass 3 left</li>
              <li>Pass 3 across</li>
              <li>Pass 3 right — may be a blind pass</li>
            </ol>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold mb-1">Courtesy pass</p>
            <p>
              After the Charleston, you and the player across may exchange
              0–3 tiles. Both must agree on the number; the lower number wins.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warning/20 p-2 rounded text-xs">
            <strong>Jokers may never be passed</strong> during any Charleston or
            courtesy pass.
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-base-content/70">
            A <em>blind pass</em> means passing 1–3 tiles face down without looking,
            taken from the tiles you just received.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-100 shadow-sm mb-2">
        <input type="checkbox" />
        <div class="collapse-title font-semibold">🎴 Play</div>
        <div class="collapse-content text-sm space-y-3">
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold mb-1">Play</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-0.5 mb-2">
              <li>Everyone holds 13 tiles; East starts with 14 and discards first</li>
              <li>Play proceeds to the right</li>
              <li>On your turn: draw, then discard</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="font-semibold mb-1">Any player may call the discarded tile if:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-0.5 mb-2">
              <li>It completes a pung, kong, or quint</li>
              <li>The hand is not concealed</li>
              <li>Tiles may not be called to complete singles or pairs unless it is the final tile needed for Mah Jongg.</li>
              <li>If two players claim the same discard, mah jongg wins; otherwise the player next in turn order gets it</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="font-semibold mb-1">When a tile is called:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-0.5">
              <li>The completed grouping is exposed on the rack</li>
              <li>The calling player takes the next turn</li>
              <li>One tile is discarded</li>
              <li>Calling tiles changes the order of play and reveals information to other players.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-100 shadow-sm mb-2">
        <input type="checkbox" />
        <div class="collapse-title font-semibold">🃏 Jokers</div>
        <div class="collapse-content text-sm space-y-2">
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
            <li>Usable in any group of <strong>3 or more identical tiles</strong> — pung, kong, quint, sextet</li>
            <li><strong>Never</strong> usable for a single or a pair</li>
            <li>Cannot be passed in the Charleston</li>
            <li>A discarded joker is dead — no one may claim it</li>
          </ul>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold mt-2 mb-1">Redeeming a joker</p>
            <p>
              On your turn, you may swap the real tile from your hand for a joker
              sitting in <em>any</em> player's exposure, including your own.
              Jokers cannot be redeemed from a pair or from a concealed hand.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-100 shadow-sm mb-2">
        <input type="checkbox" />
        <div class="collapse-title font-semibold">💵 Payouts</div>
        <div class="collapse-content text-sm space-y-2">
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
            <li>
              <strong>Won on a discard:</strong> the discarder pays
              <strong>double</strong> the hand's value; the other two each pay
              face value.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Won on a self-pick:</strong> all three players pay
              <strong>double</strong>.
            </li>
            <li><strong>Wall game:</strong> nobody pays.</li>
            <li>
              <strong>Dead hand:</strong> the player stays in and still pays the
              winner at the end.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <div class="bg-info/20 p-2 rounded text-xs">
            A <strong>jokerless bonus</strong> (commonly double) is a house rule,
            not an NMJL rule — agree on it before you start.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Floating add button (owner only) -->
    <button
      id="add-hand-btn"
      class="btn btn-primary btn-circle fixed bottom-5 right-5 shadow-lg text-2xl z-40 hidden"
      aria-label="Add hand"
    >+</button>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ── Hand editor modal ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<dialog id="hand-modal" class="modal modal-bottom sm:modal-middle">
  <div class="modal-box">
    <form method="dialog">
      <button class="btn btn-sm btn-circle btn-ghost absolute right-2 top-2">✕</button>
    </form>
    <h3 id="hand-modal-title" class="font-bold text-lg mb-3">Add Hand</h3>

    <input type="hidden" id="hand-id" />

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div class="form-control">
        <label class="label py-1"><span class="label-text text-sm">Section</span></label>
        <input
          id="hand-category"
          list="category-options"
          class="input input-bordered input-sm"
          placeholder="e.g. 2468"
        />
        <datalist id="category-options"></datalist>
      </div>

      <div class="form-control">
        <label class="label py-1">
          <span class="label-text text-sm">Pattern</span>
          <span class="label-text-alt text-xs">separate blocks with spaces</span>
        </label>
        <input
          id="hand-pattern"
          class="input input-bordered input-sm font-mono"
          placeholder="FF 2222 4444 6666"
          autocapitalize="characters"
          autocomplete="off"
          spellcheck="false"
        />
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold mb-1">Tap a block to set its color</p>
        <div id="pattern-preview" class="mj-pattern bg-base-200 rounded p-3 min-h-14"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="form-control">
        <label class="label py-1">
          <span class="label-text text-sm">Alternate pattern</span>
          <span class="label-text-alt text-xs">the “-or-” version, if any</span>
        </label>
        <input
          id="hand-alt-pattern"
          class="input input-bordered input-sm font-mono"
          placeholder="leave blank if none"
          autocapitalize="characters"
          autocomplete="off"
          spellcheck="false"
        />
      </div>

      <div id="alt-preview-wrap" class="hidden">
        <div id="alt-pattern-preview" class="mj-pattern bg-base-200 rounded p-3 min-h-14"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="form-control">
        <label class="label py-1">
          <span class="label-text text-sm">Search patterns</span>
        </label>
        <textarea
          id="hand-search-pattern"
          class="textarea textarea-bordered textarea-sm h-16"
          placeholder="leave blank if none"
          autocapitalize="characters"
          autocomplete="off"
          spellcheck="false"
        ></textarea>
      </div>

      <div class="form-control">
        <label class="label py-1"><span class="label-text text-sm">Notes</span></label>
        <textarea
          id="hand-notes"
          class="textarea textarea-bordered textarea-sm h-16"
          placeholder="Optional — e.g. 'any 3 suits'"
        ></textarea>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
      <div class="form-control">
        <label class="label py-1"><span class="label-text text-sm">Value</span></label>
        <input
          id="hand-value"
          type="number"
          inputmode="numeric"
          step="5"
          min="0"
          class="input input-bordered input-sm"
          placeholder="25"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="form-control">
        <label class="label py-1"><span class="label-text text-sm">Type</span></label>
        <select id="hand-concealed" class="select select-bordered select-sm">
          <option value="false">X — exposed</option>
          <option value="true">C — concealed</option>
        </select>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="modal-action">
      <button id="delete-hand-btn" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline btn-error mr-auto hidden">
        Delete
      </button>
      <button id="save-hand-btn" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">Save</button>
      <form method="dialog"><button class="btn btn-sm">Cancel</button></form>
    </div>
  </div>
</dialog>

<script type="module" src="{{ '/assets/js/mahjong.js' | url }}"></script>

